{"id":"lippenstift","lemma":"Lippenstift","pos":"noun","rank":4083,"glosses":["lipstick (stick of coloring substance)","lipstick (the substance as such)"],"ipa":"/ˈlɪpənˌʃtɪft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/De-Lippenstift.ogg/De-Lippenstift.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Lippenstifts","plural":"Lippenstifte"},"formAudio":{"Lippenstifts":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Lippenstifts.wav","Lippenstifte":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Lippenstifte.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich trage Lippenstift nicht gerne.","en":"I don't like to wear lipstick.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"don't mention it"}]},{"text":"Es war Lippenstift an der Tasse.","en":"There was lipstick on the cup.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"cup, mug"}]},{"text":"Dein Lippenstift ist verschmiert.","en":"Your lipstick's smeared.","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Du sollst in der Schule keinen Lippenstift tragen.","en":"You're not supposed to wear lipstick at school.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"to carry, to bear"}]},{"text":"Tom hatte überall Lippenstift im Gesicht.","en":"Tom had lipstick all over his face.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"everywhere"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"face"}]}]}